      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那之后，醒目飞鹰的跑姿在我脑中挥之不去。\n虽然奇锐骏的实力也在增长，但……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c98ce60bcb19b7a23a2b6caf7f3d28a3371e9bbf4981367e4f206d6091e66b6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
