    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22b2f1be5fc840dc0e783437",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为你会细致地调整训练项目，让我学会越来越多东西。\n照这样看来，我应该能顺利跑完沙土2000米了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9906495903316d8132c576084ecd1ef6ca3949545870985b1c5d2b06b0e099c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:416887244cd45a7efe821fd7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我这么想，但却怎么也想不到办法。对方是已经出道\n且在第一线活跃的赛马娘。实力差距是无可否认的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81a03590b415d9dfeb4a1c3aeafa2c2dbd2ed3b6a1246099ac019895ea8070ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
