      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我很清楚现在这样下去我是追不上她的。\n请你拟定更严苛的训练计划，让我能跟飞鹰子一较高下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b5e77bb5b7303aa5c6b55aee5bdc52608dce4922e049d1a6e2e24ea502ef35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
