    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d6b1fe40201b6a9cc802ec4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是我接受特雷森学园入学考时的事。\n或许是因为紧张的关系，考试当天掉了好多体重。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ba057e9ddae28a0bea75868d9ae20aadd9900bef8cc807924c2f6d675342896",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
