    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd6574443273c59b52a8884d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55e5349403e07b7b42137161",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我那天的状态却异常地好。\n脚动得很快，就像是能无止尽跑下去的感觉──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dc8bf3d176bb1b380e472c3ee7942d0db1a4bb253079f5e6a2808bf35c9a22a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d858ebba65a81cecf65f7c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c722bd21d786f3caf624521",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是能像当时一样减轻体重就能赢──我有这种预感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9478192b74db3f18c301e4e94fc8fcfba7b4a7cdf8580c1cbcc7f7725ea41ca8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e35fcdc0b53b1fd5257642f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "的确，为了拿出最佳表现，减重是最好的方法。\n因为肌力、持久力相同的状态下，体重较轻的跑者跑得更快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a75269e40014a8f5411d22b1ab6cf2236507d9e7092ec3d1f1de76365b898d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdf9de5393e23585802b3ed5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你想跑赢……醒目飞鹰吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a870b16ee88b611a10c6077dc49b0efeaf47f6d109208d9e06c3665ff33d637f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:834a9116fe0e650defd95f90",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但比起减重的好坏，我对她毫不放弃的态度感到惊讶。\n不畏惧比自己强的对手，真挚地寻找自己能做的准备──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fbcfecf461a1e16f7b3dbc130318d756d881e4156520e423ed3443b1cf46f77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdd21270d21d459f8376fcd3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是你的韧性成为了你的武器",
      "source_fingerprint": "79695e03dab67596c41cd23b675a69b27646f890b85a06f4321fcd6ca7242026",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:361ac46d714d7a0b1d7dbb32",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是你的韧性成为了你的武器",
      "source_fingerprint": "79695e03dab67596c41cd23b675a69b27646f890b85a06f4321fcd6ca7242026",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9d3b7061366be7492c0e2cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然奇锐骏一有机会就会像这样称赞我，\n但其实是我对她更感到佩服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bfd20dc36b27205535c50d6ccb06453648409edbe49397d893462c249953d4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92ae295dae35fbd6cfebfbda",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8652d9d0a7fe5879a697a2e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……这么说不太对。这跟对手是谁无关。\n那并不是重点──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b0ccaf8046d66427d155030383f1d4b1fbd30edda73f2a71c6f1bf2c5845e16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0b08d928ca28a5ab420c6fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4e955eed5001ac636242fc4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这场比赛，我有非赢不可的理由。\n无论如何都必须要跑赢的理由。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8ecf6fc543132e74bec15e54b9ca1e2dc3d95454aaf5527b223d2e3c12af8f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a03e4aefd9affa351975a738",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6dfb6547f2b63e18c7169c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，训练员。不管多辛苦都没关系。\n我会相信你，照着你的方法做的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ed53ec8256e17b9a923c463db2bb9ebf0eb2465a4d70ab553e83ae8d9854a9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8388eba89d0c8d8b6799ac5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "知道了，就重拟训练计划吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08b45451bc1e3b679553c348a810a2a62c42a2c7a1358813120f0c4c9997f9f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e973f80e7882b443c0b50265",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不知道她所说的“想赢的理由”是什么，\n但既然赛马娘想追求胜利，让它实现就是训练员的工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d0e747dfd4cf19d039657e57637a8c148d4f725e753be8ad2f8d06c3e9d3074",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e6784b38703e7192e5a715",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是我顺应奇锐骏的要求，\n决定为她准备减重的训练计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a47859f0dce840297935401ea94cba091b8a181934fca8eb33c1fa8ac886389c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:804d85bfe81ac475544f9180",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对我渐渐增加强度的训练也从不退缩，\n正是这样脚踏实地累积的努力，让她确实地成长了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c5e739ed2f3e6c73fead34d4c95700971c7bbcd8a0e38c1a2b065b926234558",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ff3392762847509700af64b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "继续钻研下去的话，她在出道后也能跑出好成绩吧。\n一想到这点，就让我更想好好锻炼她了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b90c1023a8299efcb5f56e8ebbea46ad6827af61a9f7722f4bb1ef812a332434",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa659cdb20e9970d4e08b838",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一定要更加善用你的武器！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd7ea947364789e42be80b2fc6cc4b2c5cfbd5ee878feb5ae8cad627fab94139",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab18b4968b7f8589278ef134",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一定要更加善用你的武器！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd7ea947364789e42be80b2fc6cc4b2c5cfbd5ee878feb5ae8cad627fab94139",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
